#. module: sale_user_limit_margin
#: model:mail.template,body_html:sale_user_limit_margin.email_template_limit_margin
msgid "\n"
"<p>\n"
"Approval of the sale order <strong>${object.name}</strong> is required because the sales margin limit of user <strong>${user.name}</strong> is exceeded.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"Link to access sales order: <a href=\"${object.get_base_url()}/web#id=${object.id}&action=1572&model=sale.order&view_type=form&menu_id=1100\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#875A7B;padding: 8px 16px 8px 16px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; border-radius: 5px; font-size:15px;\">View sale order</a>\n"
"\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">Thank you</p>\n"
"\n"
"            "
msgstr "\n"
"<p>\n"
"Se requiere la aprobación del pedido de venta <strong>${object.name}</strong> porque se ha superado el límite de margen de venta del usuario <strong>${user.name}</strong>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"Enlace para acceder al pedido de venta: <a href=\"${object.get_base_url()}/web#id=${object.id}&action=1572&model=sale.order&view_type=form&menu_id=1100\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color:#875A7B;padding: 8px 16px 8px 16px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; border-radius: 5px; font-size:15px;\">Ver pedido de venta</a>\n"
"\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">Gracias</p>\n"
"\n"
"            "

